THE DATASET CONTAIN SIX TABLES NAMED AS:
- customers.csv
- products.csv
- orders.csv
- order_items.csv
- returns.csv
- shipments.csv

Customers — Customer details and location information.

Products — Product, category, brand, cost, and price details.

Orders — Order, customer, payment, channel, and shipping information.

Order Items — Products purchased, quantity, discounts, and sales amount.

Shipments — Delivery dates, shipping modes, costs, and delivery status.

Returns — Returned products, quantities, reasons, and refund amounts.

